# Explicit submission path budget (maximum 8 MiB):
# src/ + public/ + configuration: 1 MiB; dist/: 5 MiB;
# package manifests + lockfile: 1 MiB; documentation + tests: 1 MiB.
# Dependencies and temporary checks have a zero-byte submission budget at every depth.
**/node_modules/
**/.vite/
**/.cache/
test/scratch/
*.tsbuildinfo
